  "description": "Do Min-soo is a psychiatrist who runs a mental health YouTube channel, but he suffers from long-standing depression and panic disorder. In the meantime, he participates in the hospital picnic held every year as the person in charge, but due to a sudden heavy snow, he becomes stranded in the rest area with the patients. As a result, opposition from citizens who are trapped together is growing stronger... \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
